# The Iron Whale - Engine Decks (CIPlay iron_whale_decks): 15 m down; the mast and its box, the boiler hall's air, the
# captain's log, the anglers, the engine store, the chief's locker (keycard), the shaft's air, the captain's door and
# room, Hedda's cage and account, the galley, the main breaker.
island The Iron Whale - Engine Decks
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Engine Decks
expect hidden captvault
expect hidden deckslights
zone stern_mast
expect step 1
open Mast box
wait 3
expect step 2
air boiler_hall
expect step 3
read Captain's log, day 40
expect step 4
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
open Engine store
wait 3
expect step 6
open Chief engineer's locker
wait 3
expect step 7
use mainbreaker
expect story breaker 0
air shaft
expect step 8
open Shaft box
wait 3
expect story fuse 3
use captdoor
expect hidden captdoor
expect shown captvault
open Captain's room
wait 3
expect step 9
air captains_room
use heddacage
expect survivor frozen_hedda
read Hedda Brask's account
expect step 10
open Officers' galley
wait 3
expect step 12
open Officers' safe
expect story galleycode 0
code galleypad 4127
expect story galleycode 1
open Officers' safe
wait 3
use mainbreaker
expect story fuse 0
expect story breaker 1
expect shown deckslights
expect done
